  <item>
    <title>024 出行、住酒店，好物分享</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68d168f72c82c9dccaadf52d</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">68d168f72c82c9dccaadf52d</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 22 Sep 2025 15:44:56 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>hi，欢迎回到红心基地。暑期东东和大脸都有出门旅行，又将值黄金周，于是我们对于自己的出行好物、好习惯等做了总结，希望和大家分享、交流。</span></p><span></span><p><span>-时间轴-</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="50">0:00:50</a> 折叠扇 - 易收纳、一物多用</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="132">0:02:12</a> 一次性胶片相机 - 轻便、便冲洗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="175">0:02:55</a> 商务卡包 - 证件独立收纳、安全便利</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="231">0:03:51</a> 帆布包 - 旅行轻便、容量大</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="275">0:04:35</a> 速干浴巾、毛巾 - 易收纳、一物多用、环保</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="355">0:05:55</a> 入住酒店好习惯</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="603">0:10:03</a> 烧水杯 - 方便实用</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="667">0:11:07</a> 出行好习惯</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="846">0:14:06</a> 洞洞鞋、溯溪鞋 - 好搭配、一物多用</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播：@chenxe @虹</span></p><span></span><p><span>bgm：to the seaside（silky soap）</span></p><span></span><p><span>树洞邮箱：853794099@qq.com</span></p>]]></description>
